a.q('reviewer_vector_admission',['reviewer_occurrence'],'Every result-occurrence field must equal the expected admitted task before vector assembly; attribution never comes from completion order or adapter position. Panels resolve to explicit nonempty reviewer vectors; duplicate profile identities fail admission and cardinality is not hard-coded.',[g(0,79,90)])
a.c('submitter_response','Canonical attributed submitter response','One canonical Product-owned submitter GraphFunction/response family binds exactly one profile whose actor is the subject submitter. Profile identity/selection/configuration/instruction/result/capabilities and response invocation/source round/ordinal/complete findings-vector digest/profile/actor/identity/digest/disposition/addressed and residual findings/evidence/schema are exact.',[g(0,92,103)])
