a.q('installer_public_boundary',['installed_substrate'],'Every released tenant claiming installed substrate publishes product.install, with no helper/CLI second identity. Root is .abiogenesis; downstream payload can live beneath .abiogenesis/<product>/<build_tenant> without redefining root. No mutable source/target workspace is an installed product. Installer cannot encode domain HOW; downstream owns meaning/contributions/policy/acceptance/instructions, ABG shared admission and runtime authority.',[g(7,22,42)])
