a.q('binding_stability_and_contract_catalog',['workspace_binding'],'AuthorityBasis includes stable identity, canonical root, mode and authority-bearing refs/digests. Immutable binding records exact verified installs/lock/toolchain/package and observer/control/executor/event/runtime/projection/archive roots, command refs and manifest paths/digests. Mutable file/process/runtime/replay/artifact/observed-root contents belong to ObservationSnapshot; new observations do not mutate/replace/invalidate stable identities. 5.0-or-later manifests need bootstrap/publicContractCatalog per referenced law; install/bind preserve catalog identity/version/digest and relative asset/schema locators; inadmissible catalog forbids bound/catalog-admissible ABG status.',[g(8,63,81)])
